                <pb facs="0530" n="464" sameAs="frus:frus1931-41v02/pg464"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Annex]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Addendum to Memorandum of Conversation of June 4,
                        1941</hi></head>
                <p>The texts of Japanese proposed revisions as given in the memorandum of
                    conversation of June 4 were copied from papers which were handed to Mr.
                    Ballantine. In most cases Mr. Ballantine was allowed to keep the paper, but in a
                    few cases the paper was returned after copy had been made. The papers which were
                    left with Mr. Ballantine are attached.<anchor n="39a" xml:id="d261-f1"/></p>
            </div>
        </body>
